{"id":"u-a702496c-7e32-4f08-ae8f-891f38e9b7a4","src":"community","title":"5/3/1  Forever 5's PRO, SSL (Leader)","author":"IronReep3r","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/yj9bMa-531-forever-5s-pro-ssl-leader","desc":"Second Set Last (SSL) is one of the most popular and simplest templates from 5/3/1 Forever, where you do 5x5 of your second set as supplemental. It is usually done as a leader for 2-3 cycles, and works perfectly with First Set Last as an anchor. Wendler recommends doing 5's PRO on main sets, meaning you do 5 reps across all main sets (instead of 5, 3, 1+). Recommended starting weight is 85-90% of TM.\n\nThe recommended assistance work for this template is 25-50 reps of Push, Pull and Single Leg/Abs every session. I have stayed within Jim's suggestions and chosen movements that best fits my weaknesses and schedule, but you are free to change the assistance work to best fit your preference. I do recommend not exceeding the recommended amounts of reps though.\n\nFor conditioning, the recommended amount for SSL is 2-3 hard sessions and 3-5 easy sessions each week.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":3,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-10-24T02:42:50.651Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Safety Bar Squat","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":70},{"r":5,"rpe":80,"x":6},{"r":5,"rpe":90}]},{"n":"Good Morning","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chin-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":70},{"r":5,"rpe":80,"x":6},{"r":5,"rpe":90}]},{"n":"Abs Crunch (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Behind-the-Neck Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,